{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are assigned as a detective in the dark streets of the city. Each case awaits your investigation: question witnesses, piece together clues, and uncover complex connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Murder Mystery Stories</i> immerses you in the depths of the stories while keeping you within a single screen. With newspaper clippings, evidence files, and phone messages, it offers a captivating detective experience. Each case forces you to make different choices; every decision affects the outcome of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to solve the murders, or will the secrets remain buried forever? Step into this interactive adventure that tests your intelligence and attention, and uncover the mysteries!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054820?t=1759858656","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054820?t=1759858656","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054820/bee64fc7165634862bbb36cc3d3a7b4fc92b2d63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759858656","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054820/bee64fc7165634862bbb36cc3d3a7b4fc92b2d63/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759858656","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are assigned as a detective in the dark streets of the city. Each case awaits your investigation: question witnesses, piece together clues, and uncover complex connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Murder Mystery Stories</i> immerses you in the depths of the stories while keeping you within a single screen. With newspaper clippings, evidence files, and phone messages, it offers a captivating detective experience. Each case forces you to make different choices; every decision affects the outcome of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to solve the murders, or will the secrets remain buried forever? Step into this interactive adventure that tests your intelligence and attention, and uncover the mysteries!</p>","developers":["Cyblux Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054820/7fa36aba133938ad234f229c7f5e67ba9a3166f4/header.jpg?t=1759858656","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Cyblux LLC. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4054820/1280013332/b12fc4bf991ac6a8c41e8f797f1a62bd74413808/1758980559/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759407740","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4054820/1280013332/b12fc4bf991ac6a8c41e8f797f1a62bd74413808/1758980559/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759407740","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4054820/1280013332/b12fc4bf991ac6a8c41e8f797f1a62bd74413808/1758980559/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759407740","id":257207418,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257207418/movie480.mp4?t=1759407740","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257207418/movie_max.mp4?t=1759407740"},"name":"MMS Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257207418/a55c285a8ecda0f3d323ae59e0b3529252cb9d5f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759407740","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257207418/movie480.webm?t=1759407740","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257207418/movie_max.webm?t=1759407740"}},{"dash_a